meta {
  name: 09 Tool Servers
  seq: 10
}

docs {
  `/api/tool-servers`: a server is registered (its credentials never come back), listed,
  changed, moved to a new URL (which drops the credentials and asks for a review), reviewed, and
  deleted, which takes it out of the project that enabled it. User B (`otherToken`) gets `404` for
  user A's server in paths and in bodies. Without a reachable MCP server Bruno cannot list tools,
  so tool modes are checked by the route tests on Postgres.
}
